1
00:00:00,003 --> 00:00:01,616
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,618 --> 00:00:03,000
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,122 --> 00:00:04,212
(Episode 56)

4
00:00:04,237 --> 00:00:06,046
What time is it, anyway?

5
00:00:06,415 --> 00:00:07,749
This guy, seriously!

6
00:00:14,822 --> 00:00:17,847
Ji Hu, my goodness!

7
00:00:23,047 --> 00:00:24,306
Thank you.

8
00:00:26,859 --> 00:00:29,343
Be careful. Let's go.

9
00:00:32,428 --> 00:00:33,635
Hello.

10
00:00:34,744 --> 00:00:36,379
Thank you. But who are you?

11
00:00:37,938 --> 00:00:41,321
- I'm Jeon Jung A.
- Jeon Jung A.

12
00:00:41,574 --> 00:00:43,240
I'm sorry.

13
00:00:43,604 --> 00:00:45,556
I was drinking with him,

14
00:00:45,885 --> 00:00:49,196
and he suddenly got so drunk
that I didn't know what to do.

15
00:00:50,151 --> 00:00:51,964
At least have some water.

16
00:00:51,965 --> 00:00:53,374
You must've had a rough time.

17
00:00:53,818 --> 00:00:55,649
Yeah. Yeong Ju.

18
00:00:56,277 --> 00:00:58,195
You didn't have to do that.

19
00:01:09,014 --> 00:01:10,014
Drink up.

20
00:01:13,851 --> 00:01:15,295
That's refreshing.

21
00:01:17,163 --> 00:01:19,560
I'm sorry. I startled you, right?

22
00:01:19,585 --> 00:01:22,494
I thought you were only close to Ji Ni.
I didn't know you were close to Ji Hu too.

23
00:01:22,519 --> 00:01:25,240
Well, he and I...

24
00:01:26,396 --> 00:01:27,396
I called a taxi.

25
00:01:27,885 --> 00:01:29,497
I could've called one myself.

26
00:01:29,648 --> 00:01:31,922
Anyway, thanks for taking care of him.
He's a big guy.

27
00:01:31,924 --> 00:01:34,588
Exactly. It was exhausting.

28
00:01:35,181 --> 00:01:37,168
I couldn't just take him anywhere.

29
00:01:37,566 --> 00:01:39,621
Next time, take it easy on the drinks.

30
00:01:40,196 --> 00:01:41,196
Okay.

31
00:01:42,798 --> 00:01:47,745
He had a matchmaking date with Yoo Young.
How'd he come home with another woman?

32
00:01:48,267 --> 00:01:50,884
- Who's the woman he came home with?
- I don't know.

33
00:01:51,192 --> 00:01:52,512
Find out who she is.

34
00:02:06,899 --> 00:02:09,127
I'm so embarrassed in front of Yeong Ju.

35
00:02:09,725 --> 00:02:11,513
What's there to be embarrassed about?
We're family.

36
00:02:11,538 --> 00:02:14,803
Ever since he gave up Juilliard
and went to England,

37
00:02:14,950 --> 00:02:17,734
everything's been going wrong for him.

38
00:02:18,432 --> 00:02:21,582
It's such a shame.
It really breaks my heart.

39
00:02:22,130 --> 00:02:23,592
Don't bring up the piano anymore.

40
00:02:23,617 --> 00:02:25,851
By now, I thought he'd be famous,

41
00:02:25,875 --> 00:02:28,198
performing with world-class musicians.

42
00:02:29,537 --> 00:02:31,495
What's the point
of talking about that now?

43
00:02:31,721 --> 00:02:34,973
It must be upsetting that his first job
in Korea ended up like this.

44
00:02:35,442 --> 00:02:39,248
And after breaking up with Do Hee,
he must be hurting a lot.

45
00:02:39,828 --> 00:02:40,934
I don't think so.

46
00:02:42,205 --> 00:02:44,215
He looked like he couldn't stand her.

47
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:48,391
Find out who came home with him today.

48
00:02:48,792 --> 00:02:52,313
I guess I fussed over that Ji Ni girl
for nothing.

49
00:02:53,225 --> 00:02:56,810
Do Hee took so many pictures of him,
and we never knew.

50
00:02:57,094 --> 00:02:58,637
He must've kept it completely hidden.

51
00:02:58,874 --> 00:03:01,094
Exactly. And not Tae O, either.

52
00:03:02,308 --> 00:03:03,942
What's gotten into Ji Hu?

53
00:03:04,657 --> 00:03:07,494
Nothing in his life is going right,

54
00:03:07,916 --> 00:03:10,549
not his career or his marriage.

55
00:03:10,570 --> 00:03:12,912
Imagine how he feels.
Let's give him some time.

56
00:03:13,444 --> 00:03:15,171
I'm sure he's not like
he was in high school.

57
00:03:15,196 --> 00:03:16,841
I don't even want to think about that.

58
00:03:17,451 --> 00:03:20,593
Just hearing that he went to Geoje
gave me the creeps.

59
00:03:23,485 --> 00:03:24,485
Why?

60
00:03:26,226 --> 00:03:29,937
You've been staying home too much lately.
That's why.

61
00:03:30,246 --> 00:03:32,800
Go out. See some people.

62
00:03:34,531 --> 00:03:36,779
Anyway, I'm wide awake now.

63
00:03:48,845 --> 00:03:51,450
Yeong Ju, this brings back old memories.

64
00:03:52,347 --> 00:03:53,981
Not for me. I've forgotten it all.

65
00:03:54,006 --> 00:03:55,469
I don't want to think about those days.

66
00:03:55,585 --> 00:03:57,315
Of course. I understand.

67
00:03:57,818 --> 00:03:58,818
Thanks.

68
00:03:59,854 --> 00:04:00,854
Yeong Ju.

69
00:04:01,625 --> 00:04:02,853
Have you seen Ji Hu?

70
00:04:02,957 --> 00:04:04,659
Ji Hu? Isn't he in his room?

71
00:04:04,683 --> 00:04:05,683
He's not there.

72
00:04:06,792 --> 00:04:08,368
Then I guess he left early.

73
00:04:09,510 --> 00:04:11,662
I was making hangover soup for him.

74
00:04:13,435 --> 00:04:17,652
Sun Kyung barely slept
and finally fell asleep at dawn.

75
00:04:17,654 --> 00:04:19,680
- Let her eat it later.
- Okay.

76
00:04:22,405 --> 00:04:24,332
It's acting up again.

77
00:04:24,631 --> 00:04:27,747
- Does she always have trouble sleeping?
- She's incredibly sensitive.

78
00:04:28,505 --> 00:04:31,383
I wonder what's gotten into Ji Hu.
He's not usually like this.

79
00:04:31,642 --> 00:04:32,642
Exactly.

80
00:04:46,932 --> 00:04:48,358
- Surprise!
- What is that?

81
00:04:48,645 --> 00:04:50,465
What do you think?
Do I look like Captain Hook?

82
00:04:52,241 --> 00:04:53,241
Cute.

83
00:04:54,169 --> 00:04:56,305
Cute? Don't I look cool?

84
00:05:26,552 --> 00:05:28,292
Why are you having ramen this early?

85
00:05:28,317 --> 00:05:30,509
If you don't want salad, have some rice.
I made some.

86
00:05:30,534 --> 00:05:32,222
I drank last night.

87
00:05:32,247 --> 00:05:33,487
You're being territorial, aren't you?

88
00:05:33,512 --> 00:05:35,770
You don't want to eat the food I made?

89
00:05:35,794 --> 00:05:38,303
Fine. I got it.

90
00:05:38,488 --> 00:05:40,602
I'll put rice in the ramen. Happy now?

91
00:05:40,626 --> 00:05:41,626
Yeah.

92
00:05:42,991 --> 00:05:45,823
You're actually pretty fun to tease.

93
00:05:45,848 --> 00:05:49,101
I'm only like this at home.

94
00:05:49,126 --> 00:05:53,095
When I'm out, people are too scared
to even talk to me.

95
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,825
Sure you are.

96
00:05:56,896 --> 00:05:58,716
Morning. How about some salad?

97
00:05:58,741 --> 00:06:00,585
I like it.

98
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,607
- Mom, I'll have rice.
- Okay.

99
00:06:17,858 --> 00:06:20,374
We're all so different.

100
00:06:21,072 --> 00:06:23,215
But it's nice
having everyone eat together.

101
00:06:23,579 --> 00:06:24,614
It's the first time, right?

102
00:06:32,573 --> 00:06:36,002
If Na Ji Ni really has a boyfriend,

103
00:06:37,167 --> 00:06:38,954
won't this backfire on Do Hee?

104
00:06:39,859 --> 00:06:42,073
Our reruns get great ratings,

105
00:06:42,476 --> 00:06:44,630
- but I'm worried.
- Me too.

106
00:06:45,116 --> 00:06:46,470
We need to do something fast.

107
00:06:50,089 --> 00:06:51,887
Ji Ni has a boyfriend?

108
00:06:52,718 --> 00:06:53,923
Besides Ji Hu?

109
00:06:54,691 --> 00:06:57,191
No way. That can't be.

110
00:06:57,985 --> 00:06:59,760
I know everything about her personal life.

111
00:06:59,785 --> 00:07:02,645
Still, we need to be careful.

112
00:07:03,139 --> 00:07:07,072
Whether it's true or not,
people only see what's on the surface.

113
00:07:07,271 --> 00:07:08,967
Don't worry.

114
00:07:09,359 --> 00:07:10,359
I'll let you go, then.

115
00:07:10,677 --> 00:07:13,109
Right. Is my guy there yet?

116
00:07:14,546 --> 00:07:16,650
Cha Seung Woo!

117
00:07:17,119 --> 00:07:18,659
My guy.

118
00:07:18,684 --> 00:07:20,193
Yes, I'll stop by this afternoon.

119
00:07:22,832 --> 00:07:24,345
She's pretty confident.

120
00:07:24,666 --> 00:07:25,778
She said not to worry.

121
00:07:27,025 --> 00:07:28,897
And she called you her guy.

122
00:07:29,186 --> 00:07:30,419
Did you make her your little sister?

123
00:07:30,492 --> 00:07:32,971
Or are you two dating now?

124
00:07:33,685 --> 00:07:35,664
Not worth responding to.

125
00:07:46,278 --> 00:07:48,367
What? What's with that look?

126
00:07:49,572 --> 00:07:52,311
I haven't been around forever,

127
00:07:52,406 --> 00:07:57,491
but in my experience,
I've rarely seen a man resist a woman...

128
00:07:57,934 --> 00:08:00,341
- acting that cute.
- Don't generalize.

129
00:08:00,549 --> 00:08:01,941
Men everywhere would object to that.

130
00:08:02,118 --> 00:08:03,187
Besides,

131
00:08:03,996 --> 00:08:05,955
don't you feel bad for Do Hee?

132
00:08:06,525 --> 00:08:08,432
Feel bad for her? Isn't she glamorous?

133
00:08:08,756 --> 00:08:11,459
She looks glamorous on the outside,
like a peacock.

134
00:08:11,761 --> 00:08:14,080
Her feathers look impressive
when they're spread,

135
00:08:15,238 --> 00:08:18,760
but she's actually tiny underneath.

136
00:08:18,855 --> 00:08:19,900
She's nothing special.

137
00:08:20,614 --> 00:08:21,708
Don't you feel bad for her?

138
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:24,725
You've got a point.

139
00:08:25,872 --> 00:08:27,100
I'm heading out.

140
00:08:49,364 --> 00:08:50,364
What?

141
00:09:09,148 --> 00:09:11,002
Ji Ni, I'm skipping the coffee.

142
00:09:11,004 --> 00:09:12,079
My stomach's bothering me.

143
00:09:13,056 --> 00:09:14,438
Jung A told me.

144
00:09:14,616 --> 00:09:16,305
She said you were completely wasted.

145
00:09:16,469 --> 00:09:17,469
That's right.

146
00:09:17,892 --> 00:09:21,014
I should've thanked her,
but I forgot that too.

147
00:09:22,092 --> 00:09:23,616
Did you enjoy your date yesterday?

148
00:09:26,058 --> 00:09:28,726
I guess this is what a date is like.
A hands-on experience, basically.

149
00:09:31,272 --> 00:09:33,735
I may not say it, but I'm rooting for you.

150
00:09:36,772 --> 00:09:39,355
I was so caught up in my pain over Do Hee.

151
00:09:39,446 --> 00:09:41,371
But you must be hurting just as much.

152
00:09:42,991 --> 00:09:44,709
As long as you can feel better,
that's what matters.

153
00:09:45,072 --> 00:09:48,033
Thanks to you, I was able
to get out of the storage room,

154
00:09:48,675 --> 00:09:50,443
so I'm sorry this happened again.

155
00:09:51,634 --> 00:09:52,634
It's okay.

156
00:09:52,739 --> 00:09:53,987
Thank you for saying that.

157
00:10:20,947 --> 00:10:22,856
How long will it take to cut all this?

158
00:10:23,186 --> 00:10:24,186
I'll be done soon.

159
00:10:26,112 --> 00:10:27,635
You're pretty good.

160
00:10:28,590 --> 00:10:30,292
It took me forever at first.

161
00:10:30,605 --> 00:10:33,230
I heard there's a machine that does this.
Want me to buy you one?

162
00:10:34,251 --> 00:10:36,559
Yeong Ju already bought me a new bed.

163
00:10:36,585 --> 00:10:38,360
- I'll buy you one.
- Maybe later.

164
00:10:38,384 --> 00:10:40,326
I actually enjoy cutting this right now.

165
00:10:40,632 --> 00:10:41,932
It clears my mind.

166
00:10:42,972 --> 00:10:44,910
I know what you mean.

167
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:47,930
Then should I help you cut some
before I go?

168
00:10:48,388 --> 00:10:51,473
It's okay. Your hand hurts.

169
00:10:52,872 --> 00:10:54,462
My right hand is fine.

170
00:10:54,612 --> 00:10:57,135
Still, two people are better than one.

171
00:11:00,565 --> 00:11:01,944
How is business going?

172
00:11:02,425 --> 00:11:03,510
It's going okay.

173
00:11:09,131 --> 00:11:10,131
Hello?

174
00:11:10,830 --> 00:11:12,846
Yes. I'm looking into it.

175
00:11:14,825 --> 00:11:18,257
Then let's meet briefly tomorrow
at a cafe in Daehangno.

176
00:11:18,692 --> 00:11:22,149
If the information is useful to us,
of course I'll pay you as promised.

177
00:11:23,935 --> 00:11:24,935
Yes.

178
00:11:27,292 --> 00:11:28,292
Who was that?

179
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:32,444
Someone says they saw
the motorcycle that hit Seung Woo's leg.

180
00:11:35,798 --> 00:11:37,230
I told you not to do that.

181
00:11:37,632 --> 00:11:40,365
- Focus when you're holding a knife.
- Okay...

182
00:11:40,705 --> 00:11:42,703
But you're still looking into that?

183
00:11:42,727 --> 00:11:44,885
Of course. How could I give up?

184
00:11:45,267 --> 00:11:46,267
Just a moment.

185
00:12:04,018 --> 00:12:05,937
It's fine.

186
00:12:07,325 --> 00:12:09,631
But why are you so surprised?

187
00:12:10,435 --> 00:12:14,235
I remember what happened back then too.

188
00:12:14,412 --> 00:12:17,336
I was so upset
when I heard about it later.

189
00:12:18,353 --> 00:12:21,259
- Leave it. I'll do the rest.
- Okay...

190
00:12:22,557 --> 00:12:23,557
You do it.

191
00:12:52,585 --> 00:12:53,585
Have a seat.

192
00:12:54,423 --> 00:12:55,423
Okay.

193
00:13:00,478 --> 00:13:01,761
I'm sorry,

194
00:13:02,893 --> 00:13:04,760
but I'd like you to leave.

195
00:13:05,353 --> 00:13:06,353
What?

196
00:13:07,263 --> 00:13:09,805
Ma'am, I'm sorry. It won't happen again.

197
00:13:10,524 --> 00:13:14,535
My son just went to Jeju,
and he's far from finishing his studies.

198
00:13:15,151 --> 00:13:17,877
I have no problem with you, but...

199
00:13:19,047 --> 00:13:21,940
your husband's sister
is now my sister-in-law.

200
00:13:22,346 --> 00:13:25,346
Do you think it's right for you two
to act like sisters-in-law...

201
00:13:25,513 --> 00:13:26,513
in my house?

202
00:13:26,765 --> 00:13:29,484
I don't like seeing the two of you...

203
00:13:29,930 --> 00:13:31,957
playing family in my kitchen.

204
00:13:32,091 --> 00:13:33,555
Ma'am, but...

205
00:13:33,586 --> 00:13:36,611
No Yeong Ju isn't your senior in-law.
She's my sister-in-law.

206
00:13:37,087 --> 00:13:38,087
I understand.

207
00:13:38,413 --> 00:13:40,428
I'll be more mindful of my behavior.

208
00:13:40,728 --> 00:13:42,200
Please give me one more chance.

209
00:13:43,116 --> 00:13:44,116
Please.

210
00:13:44,523 --> 00:13:45,637
I'll see how you do.

211
00:13:46,166 --> 00:13:47,520
You need to do better from now on.

212
00:13:47,544 --> 00:13:48,544
Sure.

213
00:13:48,645 --> 00:13:49,745
Thank you!

214
00:14:04,489 --> 00:14:05,806
Yeong Ju, what are you doing?

215
00:14:06,097 --> 00:14:07,884
Don't you know cucumbers get soggy?

216
00:14:08,363 --> 00:14:10,851
We're eating them all today.
They'll be fine.

217
00:14:10,875 --> 00:14:12,436
They'll feel rough in our mouths.

218
00:14:13,723 --> 00:14:15,320
What?

219
00:14:18,352 --> 00:14:19,352
Sister-in-law...

220
00:14:19,769 --> 00:14:21,211
No, I mean, younger madam.

221
00:14:21,565 --> 00:14:23,477
Cucumbers get soggy quickly.

222
00:14:23,785 --> 00:14:27,018
And you shouldn't talk back
to Mrs. Kim like that.

223
00:14:27,267 --> 00:14:29,331
Someone in your position shouldn't.

224
00:14:29,752 --> 00:14:31,712
This is Mrs. Kim's kitchen.

225
00:14:32,166 --> 00:14:33,166
What?

226
00:14:33,621 --> 00:14:35,524
- Sister-in-law.
- Call me by my name.

227
00:14:35,718 --> 00:14:38,311
Our relationship is awkward here.

228
00:14:41,611 --> 00:14:42,611
Okay.

229
00:14:43,099 --> 00:14:44,099
I understand.

230
00:14:44,437 --> 00:14:46,662
Stick those cucumber slices
on your own face.

231
00:14:53,892 --> 00:14:54,911
What's wrong, Su Yeon?

232
00:14:55,805 --> 00:14:57,244
I'm having a hard time too.

233
00:14:59,498 --> 00:15:04,126
Mrs. Kim has her reasons
for saying that, so do as she says.

234
00:15:04,314 --> 00:15:05,431
Understand?

235
00:15:14,498 --> 00:15:16,992
I'm sorry. Something came up
at lunchtime today.

236
00:15:17,013 --> 00:15:18,526
I wanted to treat you to lunch.

237
00:15:18,813 --> 00:15:20,019
It's okay.

238
00:15:20,278 --> 00:15:22,858
You sent flowers to the show.
It's the least I can do.

239
00:15:23,165 --> 00:15:24,996
Thank you for the snacks too.

240
00:15:24,998 --> 00:15:27,451
I've never gotten a purple bouquet before.

241
00:15:27,592 --> 00:15:30,099
The florist recommended that one.

242
00:15:30,218 --> 00:15:31,914
I have no eye for that sort of thing.

243
00:15:32,095 --> 00:15:33,440
You're honest.

244
00:15:33,767 --> 00:15:35,736
Thanks to you, I even got to buy clothes
for my wife.

245
00:15:36,057 --> 00:15:38,679
I had never bought her clothes before.
I just gave her my card.

246
00:15:39,111 --> 00:15:41,264
I always get it wrong
when I pick them out.

247
00:15:41,439 --> 00:15:42,633
We all do.

248
00:15:42,891 --> 00:15:45,875
At least she gets to use your card.
I'm jealous of that.

249
00:15:46,188 --> 00:15:48,489
I take it you lost your husband?

250
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,991
It hasn't been long.

251
00:15:52,385 --> 00:15:54,748
People say you can get depressed
after losing a spouse,

252
00:15:54,750 --> 00:15:57,485
but I haven't had time for that.
I have to make a living.

253
00:16:00,258 --> 00:16:02,231
- Hello.
- Hello.

254
00:16:02,599 --> 00:16:03,901
It's been a while.

255
00:16:04,102 --> 00:16:05,271
How have you been?

256
00:16:09,192 --> 00:16:10,876
Sorry to interrupt your conversation.

257
00:16:11,472 --> 00:16:14,145
- Please say hello to Sun Kyung for me.
- Sure.

258
00:16:20,292 --> 00:16:21,538
I'm sorry.

259
00:16:21,696 --> 00:16:23,316
I ran into an old friend of my wife's.

260
00:16:23,317 --> 00:16:24,414
No, it's okay.

261
00:16:24,418 --> 00:16:26,924
I hope I'm not making things
awkward for you.

262
00:16:26,925 --> 00:16:29,410
Not at all. Don't worry.

263
00:16:30,634 --> 00:16:32,972
Are you doing another fashion show?

264
00:16:33,038 --> 00:16:34,281
I'd love to go next time.

265
00:16:34,282 --> 00:16:36,111
Sure. You must come.

266
00:16:37,078 --> 00:16:40,376
I guess I've got some talent.
I've been getting calls from everywhere.

267
00:16:40,804 --> 00:16:43,412
Of course. You have great style.

268
00:16:43,939 --> 00:16:46,511
Should I get your autograph in advance?

269
00:16:47,705 --> 00:16:49,349
I hope it comes to that.

270
00:16:50,372 --> 00:16:53,005
By the way, what should I call you?

271
00:16:53,938 --> 00:16:56,764
The note on the flowers said Im Joong Bin?

272
00:16:56,859 --> 00:16:57,859
Yes.

273
00:16:58,065 --> 00:17:00,648
Then I'll call you Se Ri.

274
00:17:01,265 --> 00:17:02,348
Sure. I like that.

275
00:17:07,112 --> 00:17:08,861
I enjoyed your show.

276
00:17:08,968 --> 00:17:10,438
Aren't you just perfect?

277
00:17:10,772 --> 00:17:12,433
You went to Cambridge too?

278
00:17:12,492 --> 00:17:13,733
Which college was it?

279
00:17:16,435 --> 00:17:17,588
Serenity.

280
00:17:17,732 --> 00:17:19,394
The buildings there are amazing.

281
00:17:19,488 --> 00:17:20,578
Have you been there?

282
00:17:20,772 --> 00:17:23,097
I heard you went to school in America.

283
00:17:23,410 --> 00:17:25,523
I went a few times during breaks.

284
00:17:25,677 --> 00:17:27,671
The view of the River Cam is incredible.

285
00:17:27,784 --> 00:17:30,478
It is. I used to run
along it every morning.

286
00:17:30,641 --> 00:17:32,843
I bet other guys chased after you too.

287
00:17:32,844 --> 00:17:33,844
Like me today?

288
00:17:38,578 --> 00:17:40,257
Thank you for the compliment.

289
00:17:40,451 --> 00:17:42,503
Filming this time was exhausting.

290
00:17:42,931 --> 00:17:45,052
Have you ever been to a film set?

291
00:17:45,393 --> 00:17:47,525
- Would you like me to show you around?
- No, thank you.

292
00:17:47,565 --> 00:17:49,858
I've been there several times
for my dad's company commercials.

293
00:17:51,149 --> 00:17:52,918
I heard you majored in business.

294
00:17:53,245 --> 00:17:55,431
I think my friend was in your class.

295
00:17:55,745 --> 00:17:56,829
Do you know James?

296
00:17:56,849 --> 00:17:58,642
His Korean name is Jun Seong.

297
00:17:58,950 --> 00:18:00,375
Jun Seong...

298
00:18:00,918 --> 00:18:02,392
I think I've heard of him.

299
00:18:03,898 --> 00:18:07,724
Anyway, while we were filming,
the women were so jealous.

300
00:18:08,065 --> 00:18:11,119
Won't you have to live with jealousy
your whole life?

301
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:12,807
Your dad is an ambassador too.

302
00:18:13,404 --> 00:18:16,460
The last guy said he'd gone to Cambridge,

303
00:18:16,554 --> 00:18:18,457
but he was only in a foundation course.

304
00:18:20,810 --> 00:18:23,184
He hadn't even been officially admitted.

305
00:18:23,401 --> 00:18:26,640
If he didn't get in, he should've said so.
Why hide it?

306
00:18:26,672 --> 00:18:29,749
I can't deal with someone who's insecure
about his education.

307
00:18:29,750 --> 00:18:31,704
His inferiority complex wears me out.

308
00:18:34,551 --> 00:18:35,773
Yes, you're right.

309
00:18:36,498 --> 00:18:38,645
- I need to use the restroom.
- Okay.

310
00:18:40,551 --> 00:18:41,836
Why take your bag...

311
00:18:47,089 --> 00:18:49,775
What a crazy bastard. A total psycho.

312
00:18:50,390 --> 00:18:51,390
What a joke.

313
00:18:57,552 --> 00:18:58,940
But why did you choose me?

314
00:18:59,365 --> 00:19:00,513
As you said,

315
00:19:01,064 --> 00:19:03,174
plenty of men would fall at your feet,

316
00:19:03,516 --> 00:19:04,516
so why choose me?

317
00:19:04,911 --> 00:19:07,205
- Because...
- I hid that you weren't studying abroad?

318
00:19:11,012 --> 00:19:13,538
So what? If it doesn't work out, fine.

319
00:19:19,687 --> 00:19:21,994
(Mine)

320
00:19:40,132 --> 00:19:41,215
You're here early.

321
00:19:51,125 --> 00:19:52,598
Doesn't it bother you?

322
00:19:54,872 --> 00:19:56,599
That's a strange way to put it.

323
00:19:56,965 --> 00:19:59,665
It's not comfortable,
but I'm used to it now.

324
00:19:59,685 --> 00:20:02,271
Seung Hyun got a call
saying there's a witness.

325
00:20:03,118 --> 00:20:05,891
Mom won't give up,
even though I told her to stop.

326
00:20:06,605 --> 00:20:07,762
Yeong Ju, honestly...

327
00:20:07,818 --> 00:20:09,258
She should give up already.

328
00:20:09,691 --> 00:20:11,276
What's the point of finding them now?

329
00:20:11,278 --> 00:20:12,878
You have no right to say that.

330
00:20:13,578 --> 00:20:15,648
Why do you think I was running
the day I had that accident?

331
00:20:17,309 --> 00:20:18,309
Right.

332
00:20:18,612 --> 00:20:20,472
I shouldn't interfere.

333
00:20:22,512 --> 00:20:24,068
You said you'd give me the company?

334
00:20:24,645 --> 00:20:26,165
Yes. Did you change your mind?

335
00:20:26,167 --> 00:20:28,232
Will you hand it all over to me? Will you?

336
00:20:28,458 --> 00:20:31,772
Could my shares go to Ji Ni?

337
00:20:31,774 --> 00:20:32,835
Just do that for me.

338
00:20:33,179 --> 00:20:35,712
Okay. But it's like owning stock.

339
00:20:35,758 --> 00:20:37,405
- If you want anything from me...
- Okay.

340
00:20:37,445 --> 00:20:39,990
I won't interfere.
Handle it however you want.

341
00:20:41,459 --> 00:20:42,459
Then,

342
00:20:44,578 --> 00:20:46,481
let's draw up a contract.

343
00:20:46,908 --> 00:20:48,651
Look it over and tell me what you think.

344
00:20:49,851 --> 00:20:51,004
(Agreement to Transfer Shares
and Management Control)

345
00:20:51,672 --> 00:20:54,497
But why did you change your mind?

346
00:20:55,812 --> 00:20:57,807
I want to make documentaries
on my own terms.

347
00:20:59,418 --> 00:21:01,306
You're definitely your dad's son.

348
00:21:02,018 --> 00:21:04,981
Min Ki was into documentaries too.

349
00:21:05,014 --> 00:21:07,998
Please don't bring him up.
It bothers me, just like this leg.

350
00:21:08,213 --> 00:21:11,183
And please remove all those notebooks
from the drawer.

351
00:21:11,622 --> 00:21:13,398
Okay. I will.

352
00:21:25,218 --> 00:21:26,751
(O Reum's Banh Xeo)

353
00:21:50,172 --> 00:21:51,740
You're a very loving dad.

354
00:21:54,685 --> 00:21:56,119
They're the reason I keep going.

355
00:21:56,365 --> 00:21:57,412
What can I get you?

356
00:21:58,272 --> 00:22:00,238
One original and one spicy, please.

357
00:22:00,312 --> 00:22:02,908
Where's your wife? Are you on your own?

358
00:22:04,129 --> 00:22:06,332
She's on a trip. She'll be back soon.

359
00:22:07,058 --> 00:22:08,765
I've got some ready. I'll give you some.

360
00:22:08,766 --> 00:22:09,766
Okay.

361
00:22:13,178 --> 00:22:15,610
- One spicy and one original.
- Yes.

362
00:22:21,512 --> 00:22:23,529
- Thank you. Enjoy!
- Thank you.

363
00:22:24,118 --> 00:22:26,911
I An! Slow down. Don't run.

364
00:22:27,571 --> 00:22:30,138
I An, stay by my side.

365
00:22:30,912 --> 00:22:32,552
You'll fall. I said slow down.

366
00:22:40,092 --> 00:22:41,548
Could we get one banh xeo...

367
00:22:43,068 --> 00:22:44,585
Welcome! What would you like?

368
00:22:44,587 --> 00:22:46,309
One banh xeo. Which flavor do you want?

369
00:22:46,311 --> 00:22:48,031
- I want spicy.
- A spicy banh xeo, please.

370
00:22:48,033 --> 00:22:50,121
- Okay. I'll make it right away.
- Okay.

371
00:23:13,231 --> 00:23:15,039
Let's stop acting like we're a couple.

372
00:23:15,046 --> 00:23:17,573
I meant it when I said
I wanted to protect you.

373
00:23:17,574 --> 00:23:19,210
I know. Thank you.

374
00:23:20,071 --> 00:23:22,093
But just to avoid Do Do Hee,

375
00:23:22,095 --> 00:23:24,290
I think I chose
an approach that's just not me.

376
00:23:25,190 --> 00:23:26,190
I'm uncomfortable with it.

377
00:24:27,598 --> 00:24:29,548
- You two went running?
- Yes.

378
00:24:30,704 --> 00:24:32,174
For both of us,

379
00:24:32,359 --> 00:24:35,525
I think the urge to escape our past
just exploded.

380
00:24:36,312 --> 00:24:38,130
We kept laughing as we ran together.

381
00:24:38,252 --> 00:24:41,012
It's like a movie about young love.

382
00:24:43,698 --> 00:24:44,755
By the way,

383
00:24:45,010 --> 00:24:47,998
before you married my uncle,
you turned him down many times.

384
00:24:48,591 --> 00:24:49,591
At the time,

385
00:24:49,704 --> 00:24:52,947
was it difficult having him pursue you
despite all your rejections?

386
00:24:54,365 --> 00:24:55,884
It was hard,

387
00:24:56,205 --> 00:25:00,012
but without his persistence,
I wouldn't have found the courage.

388
00:25:00,745 --> 00:25:03,814
Without that, I might've gone on living,

389
00:25:04,067 --> 00:25:07,257
having lost happiness long ago.

390
00:25:07,285 --> 00:25:08,805
I can't tell you how grateful I am.

391
00:25:08,878 --> 00:25:10,118
Would Ji Ni feel that way...

392
00:25:10,948 --> 00:25:11,948
Wait.

393
00:25:12,265 --> 00:25:13,448
So it's Ji Ni?

394
00:25:13,999 --> 00:25:15,118
Did you know?

395
00:25:15,226 --> 00:25:16,498
Of course I knew.

396
00:25:17,065 --> 00:25:19,958
I sensed it when you two helped me
with my wedding preparations.

397
00:25:20,365 --> 00:25:23,314
Ji Ni didn't give anything away,
but your feelings were obvious.

398
00:25:23,632 --> 00:25:25,298
She still doesn't show how she feels.

399
00:25:26,098 --> 00:25:29,015
After all the hurt she's been through,

400
00:25:29,058 --> 00:25:31,489
how could she open her heart so easily?

401
00:25:32,337 --> 00:25:33,337
I understand.

402
00:25:35,492 --> 00:25:38,533
I had a complicated history
with Ji Ni's mother too.

403
00:25:40,244 --> 00:25:42,297
Should I be telling you this?

404
00:25:42,352 --> 00:25:44,071
About Ji Ni and the bone marrow...

405
00:25:45,078 --> 00:25:46,357
You know about that too?

406
00:25:46,752 --> 00:25:48,725
So you two really are dating?

407
00:25:48,838 --> 00:25:50,091
No, we're not.

408
00:25:50,658 --> 00:25:53,079
Ji Ni is so determined to reject love.

409
00:25:53,489 --> 00:25:54,706
Honestly, that girl...

410
00:25:55,151 --> 00:25:57,711
Does rejecting love really keep it away?

411
00:25:59,645 --> 00:26:01,241
Around the time of the transplant,

412
00:26:01,894 --> 00:26:04,052
she once collapsed near the hospital.

413
00:26:05,171 --> 00:26:07,370
I found her and saved her.

414
00:26:08,691 --> 00:26:11,740
She really impressed me that day.

415
00:26:13,552 --> 00:26:15,605
How did she find the courage to do it?

416
00:26:18,125 --> 00:26:20,302
I'm still tied to my past in so many ways.

417
00:26:20,805 --> 00:26:22,331
You? To what?

418
00:26:22,858 --> 00:26:24,476
You're from such a wonderful family,

419
00:26:24,822 --> 00:26:27,029
and you're a perfect Prince Charming.

420
00:26:27,405 --> 00:26:30,197
Didn't you call yourself
the Little Mermaid last time?

421
00:26:31,398 --> 00:26:33,549
I think it's my burden to bear.

422
00:26:36,252 --> 00:26:39,552
I wish I could forget it all
and finally be at peace, Auntie.

423
00:26:40,717 --> 00:26:41,717
Ji Hu.

424
00:26:43,518 --> 00:26:45,717
My heart still hurts so much,

425
00:26:46,524 --> 00:26:48,685
but seeing Ji Ni in the hospital bed,

426
00:26:50,185 --> 00:26:52,540
I wondered, "How can she be so brave?"

427
00:26:54,178 --> 00:26:58,064
"How could she go this far
for the official wife's grandson?"

428
00:26:59,385 --> 00:27:00,759
That's what I was thinking.

429
00:27:02,125 --> 00:27:04,836
I was surprised back then too.

430
00:27:05,678 --> 00:27:07,984
I'd cursed her so many times.

431
00:27:09,165 --> 00:27:11,374
I even wished she'd end up like me.

432
00:27:13,845 --> 00:27:16,912
It was a truly horrible curse.

433
00:27:22,385 --> 00:27:23,428
Ji Hu.

434
00:27:25,558 --> 00:27:26,830
With your love,

435
00:27:27,672 --> 00:27:29,720
I hope Ji Ni can change.

436
00:27:32,505 --> 00:27:33,727
I really mean it.

437
00:27:34,334 --> 00:27:36,713
I hope Ji Ni finds happiness in love.

438
00:27:38,168 --> 00:27:39,372
I'll be rooting for you.

439
00:27:39,754 --> 00:27:40,754
I'll be hoping for you.

440
00:27:42,545 --> 00:27:44,713
Ji Ni really seems to hate love.

441
00:27:48,458 --> 00:27:52,235
Auntie, how do I hide my feelings?

442
00:27:53,358 --> 00:27:55,459
How am I supposed to hold them all in?

443
00:27:56,169 --> 00:27:57,892
What am I going to do with you two?

444
00:27:58,301 --> 00:27:59,572
It's all because of us.

445
00:28:30,263 --> 00:28:33,568
(Family Register)

446
00:28:33,570 --> 00:28:35,957
It makes me happy
just imagining us confessing our love.

447
00:28:35,959 --> 00:28:37,703
Ji Hu, stop going on matchmaking dates.

448
00:28:37,705 --> 00:28:39,732
Just let them blame us.
Who cares if it's unfair?

449
00:28:39,734 --> 00:28:40,871
Do you have to put it like that?

450
00:28:40,872 --> 00:28:42,156
Everything makes me angry these days.

451
00:28:42,158 --> 00:28:44,028
- I won't keep putting up with it.
- My brother isn't himself anymore.

452
00:28:44,030 --> 00:28:45,763
Right. He's been acting strange.

453
00:28:45,765 --> 00:28:48,261
Are you the baby's mom
from the motorcycle accident?

454
00:28:48,262 --> 00:28:49,835
I hear you're looking for a witness.

455
00:28:49,836 --> 00:28:51,397
The police station?
Why is Seung Hyun there?

456
00:28:51,398 --> 00:28:53,718
Do you know anything about it?

457
00:28:55,011 --> 00:28:57,011
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
